    "caption": "This is a sprawling, vertically and horizontally complex Mega Man level that descends from a high platform area into a deep vertical shaft before opening into a massive enemy-filled gauntlet.\n\nThe level begins with the player spawn (P) on the lower left, where a stepped floor of solid ground blocks leads rightward. The upper-right opens into a series of floating platforms guarded by spawners (o), a ranged enemy (r), and powerups including a \"+\" item and a \"Z\" collectible, with a long climbable ladder (|) anchoring the right structure.\n\nA long climbable ladder descends through the center-left, flanked by deadly spike beds (H) that line both walls and floors of the descent, demanding careful navigation. At the bottom, the path turns into a wide, enemy-dense arena. Here, columns of ranged enemies (c) and jumping enemies (j, m) populate a grid of solid platforms separated by gaps, creating a tense leaping challenge. Health/powerup pickups (L, W, ll) reward thorough exploration.\n\nThe lower section features a tall climbable shaft on the right edge, while the bottom-left holds a separate horizontal corridor full of jumping enemies (q), more spikes (H), and stepped block formations. The far right two-thirds of the level is filled with null/out-of-bounds space (@), confining the playable area to a winding, hazard-laden route.\n\nOverall, this is a challenging mid-to-late stage emphasizing vertical ladder climbing past spikes, platform-hopping over gaps amid ranged and jumping enemies, and collecting scattered powerups."
